sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Fortify
    participant DB

    User->>Browser: Enter email + password
    Browser->>Fortify: POST /login
    Fortify->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>Fortify: User record
    Fortify->>Fortify: Hash::check(password, hash)

    alt Invalid credentials
        Fortify-->>Browser: 422 Unprocessable
        Browser-->>User: Show error message
    else Valid + 2FA enabled
        Fortify-->>Browser: Redirect /two-factor-challenge
        User->>Browser: Enter TOTP code
        Browser->>Fortify: POST /two-factor-challenge
        Fortify->>Fortify: Verify TOTP code
        Fortify-->>Browser: Redirect /dashboard
        Browser-->>User: Dashboard
    else Valid + no 2FA
        Fortify-->>Browser: Redirect /dashboard
        Browser-->>User: Dashboard
    end
